<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-Russia sets 14.41 pct coupon rate.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russia sets 14.41 pct coupon rate.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry has set a 14.41 percent, or 35,926 roubles coupon rate for the seventh coupon of series 24006 OFZ interest-bearing bonds, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			    seventh coupon	   sixth coupon</p>
<p>    pct		   14.41			25.78</p>
<p>    rouble terms	35,926		     64,273</p>
<p>    coupon date	 Nov 5, 1997		Aug 6, 1997</p>
<p>On August 6, the Finance Ministry will make an early repayment of the bond on a voluntary basis as it is trying to replace tax-exempt paper with taxable issues.</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
